@host = http://localhost:5000
@api = {{host}}/api

### Health check
GET {{host}}/

### List tickets
GET {{api}}/tickets

### Log in (password for every demo user is Test@1234)
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "supervisor@helpdesk.local",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### Create a ticket (requester id 4 = Demo Requester, category 1 = Network / IT)
POST {{api}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Internet not working in C Block",
  "description": "No connection since morning",
  "category_id": 1,
  "priority": "High",
  "requester_id": 4
}